gy we need. UCS is stuck in denial, pushing a narrative that blames everyone else while ignoring the hard truth: their favored tech isn't up to the job.\n\nThis sounds like the classic denial stage of grief. As reality sets in, greens will have to face the fact that their climate crusade isn't winning. The next few years could see some serious soul-searching—or more finger-pointing. Either way, it's a fascinating watch.\n\nTo read the full article go to https://t.co/6SAwdR3Jfk","entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"wattsupwiththat.com/2025/12/13/ucs…","expanded_url":"https://wattsupwiththat.com/2025/12/13/ucs-tackling-climate-change-requires-scaling-up-clean-tech-and-phasing-out-fossil-fuels/","url":"https://t.co/6SAwdR3Jfk","indices":[1374,1397]}],"user_mentions":[]}}}},"grok_analysis_button":true,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":0,"bookmarked":false,"created_at":"Sat Dec 13 18:01:03 +0000 2025","conversation_id_str":"1999902401042547193","display_text_range":[0,206],"entities":{"hashtags":[],"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/oFbOhbTQEN","expanded_url":"https://x.com/wattsupwiththat/status/1999902401042547193/photo/1","id_str":"1999902372840038405","indices":[207,230],"media_key":"3_1999902372840038405","media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G8EUnLaXYAUgb9r.jpg","type":"photo","url":"https://t.co/oFbOhbTQEN","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"features":{"large":{"faces":[]},"medium":{"faces":[]},"small":{"faces":[]},"orig":{"faces":[]}},"sizes":{"large":{"h":512,"w":1024,"resize":"fit"},"medium":{"h":512,"w":1024,"resize":"fit"},"small":{"h":340,"w":680,"resize":"fit"},"thumb":{"h":150,"w":150,"resize":"crop"}},"original_info":{"height":512,"width":1024,"focus_rects":[{"x":55,"y":0,"w":914,"h":512},{"x":256,"y":0,"w":512,"h":512},{"x":288,"y":0,"w":449,"h":512},{"x":384,"y":0,"w":256,"h":512},{"x":0,"y":0,"w":1024,"h":512}]},"media_results":{"result":{"media_key":"3_1999902372840038405"}}}],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"u