gs vary North to South, as during glacial periods on the Northern Hemisphere, tropical and sub tropical temperature ranges were similar as today's. The alarmists forget the earth is dynamic. They claim today is normal, when it is far from it. Ask any of them how 5,000 feet of ice was over Northern North America. They have no answer.","entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]}}}},"grok_analysis_button":true,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":0,"bookmarked":false,"created_at":"Sat Dec 13 18:13:33 +0000 2025","conversation_id_str":"1999723869033365642","display_text_range":[13,285],"entities":{"hashtags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[{"id_str":"1793048733942235136","name":"Peter Clack","screen_name":"PeterDClack","indices":[0,12]}]},"favorite_count":0,"favorited":false,"full_text":"@PeterDClack The average person has succumbed to climate alarmism due to the facts on the orgins on the data sets from the past being withheld, and the manipulation of these last data sets to bias the alarmists models. The data sets are: tree ring (growth), ships logs (seaborne), land","in_reply_to_screen_name":"PeterDClack","in_reply_to_status_id_str":"1999723869033365642","in_reply_to_user_id_str":"1793048733942235136","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"en","quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"1864526532619988992","id_str":"1999905545919119550"},"id":"1999905545919119550","promoted":false},"id":1184}
