nd half a watt per square metre per decade. One watt per square metre adds ~2.4°C to the planet's eventual temperature (see Hansen's Pipeline paper).\n\n-  The IPCC's 2019 report stated that the oceans, ice sheets and permafrost are committed to change on millennial timescales. GHG concentrations, sea levels and global climates cannot stabilise while oceans, ice sheets and permafrost are changing.\n\nSee the highlights tab on my profile page for more information.","entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]}}}},"grok_analysis_button":true,"quoted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","rest_id":"1996687971920363691","core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","id":"VXNlcjoxOTM0ODk5MTAyOTQ2Mzg1OTIw","rest_id":"1934899102946385920","affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1965366419853357056/xga4xls5_normal.jpg"},"core":{"created_at":"Tue Jun 17 09:01:42 +0000 2025","name":"National Emergency Briefing","screen_name":"nebriefing"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"is_blue_verified":false,"legacy":{"default_profile":true,"default_profile_image":false,"description":"UK's top experts mount official briefing for MPs & leaders on the latest science to galvanise action on climate & nature crisis. Add your signature👇","entities":{"description":{"urls":[]},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"nebriefing.org/open-letter-ke…","expanded_url":"https://www.nebriefing.org/open-letter-keir","url":"https://t.co/HWjdQ4BKkG","indices":[0,23]}]}},"fast_followers_count":0,"favourites_count":307,"followers_count":661,"friends_count":68,"has_custom_timelines":false,"is_translator":false,"listed_count":2,"media_count":64,"normal_followers_count":661,"pinned_tweet_ids_str":["1995524222626509087"],"possibly_sensitive":false,"profile_banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1934899102946385920/1757413478","profile_interstitial_type":"","st