 especially during menstruation has access to safe, clean and dignified spaces.\n\nFinally, my sincere thanks to the organizers for bringing together the East African Community Youth Symposium a much-needed platform where young leaders can push for accountability, influence policy and champion the SRHR agenda across the region.\n\n#SRHR #EACreatorNetwork #EACYouthPolicy2025","entity_set":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[143,167],"text":"EACYouthSymposiumOnSRHR"},{"indices":[464,468],"text":"GBV"},{"indices":[1177,1182],"text":"SRHR"},{"indices":[1183,1200],"text":"EACreatorNetwork"},{"indices":[1201,1220],"text":"EACYouthPolicy2025"}],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[{"id_str":"1018146684759695360","name":"African Youth Federation","screen_name":"AfricanYouthFdn","indices":[10,26]}]},"richtext":{"richtext_tags":[{"from_index":65,"to_index":129,"richtext_types":["Bold"]},{"from_index":129,"to_index":130,"richtext_types":["Bold"]},{"from_index":379,"to_index":384,"richtext_types":["Bold"]},{"from_index":799,"to_index":803,"richtext_types":["Bold"]}]}}}},"grok_analysis_button":true,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":0,"bookmarked":false,"created_at":"Fri Dec 12 15:56:47 +0000 2025","conversation_id_str":"1999508739066368392","display_text_range":[0,283],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[143,167],"text":"EACYouthSymposiumOnSRHR"}],"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/6gy6DPehv3","expanded_url":"https://x.com/JoviaKusiima_/status/1999508739066368392/photo/1","id_str":"1999508726516977669","indices":[284,307],"media_key":"3_1999508726516977669","media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G7-ul8lWkAURMTm.jpg","type":"photo","url":"https://t.co/6gy6DPehv3","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"features":{"all":{"tags":[{"user_id":"1627067798685110277","name":"Greater Impact Africa","screen_name":"GIA_Fdn","type":"user"},{"user_id":"1973435441043890176","name":"African Jewelry Uganda","screen_name":"AfriJewelryUG","type":"user"},{"user_id":"2653300837","name":"EU in Uga