"","statuses_count":55684,"translator_type":"none","url":"https://t.co/T5CEcqToIU","want_retweets":false,"withheld_in_countries":[]},"location":{"location":"🚀🏙️"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","profile_image_shape":"Circle","profile_bio":{"description":"Meteorologist / science policy analyst @CFACT | Politically incorrect | Lukewarmer | “The Anti-Greta Thunberg” – NY Post | 📧 cmartz@cfact.org"},"privacy":{"protected":false},"relationship_perspectives":{"following":false},"tipjar_settings":{"is_enabled":false},"verification":{"verified":false}}}},"unmention_data":{},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["1831880692600598679"],"editable_until_msecs":"1725592966000","is_edit_eligible":true,"edits_remaining":"5"},"is_translatable":false,"views":{"count":"45542","state":"EnabledWithCount"},"source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com/download/iphone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPhone</a>","note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4MzE4ODA2OTIzODI1MTExMDQ=","text":"Here’s what it boils down to.\n\nClimate activists want you to think that their intentions are good. They want you to think that they care about protecting the environment. 🌍\n\nThey want you to believe the weather of today is worse than it ever has been, and that every extreme event that occurs somewhere is the fault of our burning of ancient carbon for affordable energy that powers modern civilization, has lifted billions from poverty and has more than doubled global average life expectancy since the 19th century.\n\nBut, if you examine all of their proposed “solutions,” all of them involve expansion of governmental power and are rooted in anti-capitalist ideology.\n\n“Climate action” = government control over supply and distribution of energy by regulating oil extraction and petroleum production, socializing energy via federal subsidies to jumpstart solar PV and wind projects and taxing us into poverty such that we become a poor slave class to an authoritarian regime.\n\nClimate policy revolves entirely around controlling the,\n\n• Type of vehicle you can drive, 🚘\n\n• Type of stove you can use, 🍳\n\n• Banning hot water heaters, 🚿\n\n• Type of appliances you can purchase,\n\n• Type of food you can eat (e.g., forcing you to eat lab-grown meat, bugs and/or adhere to a vegan diet), 🥩\n\n• Confining you to a 15-minute city where your daily activities are under constant surveillance, and 🏙️\n\n• Establishing a cashless society to put you on a “carbon credit system” whereby you are given a monthly allowance on how much carbon dioxide emissions you can produce through the food you eat, products you buy or amount of travel. All of your purchases are tracked such that if you exceed the limit, you’re required to purchase more credits or otherwise your credit / debit card will be shut off. 💳\n\nThe goal of “net zero” is to reduce your quality of life and make you dependent on the government for survival.\n\nIt’s not about environmental protection.\n\nIt’s not about sustainability.\n\nIt’s about control.","entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]}}}},"grok_analysis_button":true,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":271,"bookmarked":false,"created_at":"Fri Sep 06 02:22:46 +0000 2024","conversation_id_str":"1831880692600598679","display_text_range":[0,274],"entities":{"hashtags":[],"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/GNOQv7QweS","expanded_url":"https://x.com/ChrisMartzWX/status/1831880692600598679/photo/1","id_str":"1831880688389201920","indices":[275,298],"media_key":"3_1831880688389201920","media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GWwlx8ZWIAAOkV8.jpg","type":"photo","url":"https://t.co/GNOQv7QweS","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"features":{"large":{"faces":[{"x":125,"y":186,"h":267,"w":267}]},"medium":{"faces":[{"x":125,"y":186,"h":267,"w":267}]},"small":{"faces":[{"x":125,"y":186,"h":267,"w":267}]},"orig":{"faces":[{"x":125,"y":186,"h":26