e dangerous.\n\nAt the same time, Earth-system science shows that key climate tipping points become likely between 1.5 °C and 3 °C, and we are already brushing that zone.\n\nIn plain terms: the administration is slowing the only technologies that work fast enough, while doubling down on the fuels that caused the crisis, during the single most critical decade for preventing irreversible climate damage.\n\nFrom a risk-management perspective, that isn’t just “slow” policy — it’s reckless systemic risk. #NetZero #Energy #Corruption  #ClimateCrisis #TippingPoints #FossilFuelLobby #CleanEnergyNow #RecklessLeadership #DrStrangelove","entity_set":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[7,15],"text":"climate"},{"indices":[1306,1314],"text":"NetZero"},{"indices":[1315,1322],"text":"Energy"},{"indices":[1323,1334],"text":"Corruption"},{"indices":[1336,1350],"text":"ClimateCrisis"},{"indices":[1351,1365],"text":"TippingPoints"},{"indices":[1366,1382],"text":"FossilFuelLobby"},{"indices":[1383,1398],"text":"CleanEnergyNow"},{"indices":[1399,1418],"text":"RecklessLeadership"},{"indices":[1419,1433],"text":"DrStrangelove"}],"symbols":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]}}}},"grok_analysis_button":true,"legacy":{"bookmark_count":0,"bookmarked":false,"created_at":"Wed Dec 10 23:31:16 +0000 2025","conversation_id_str":"1998898338976911758","display_text_range":[0,275],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[7,15],"text":"climate"}],"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/SNsirf3oop","expanded_url":"https://x.com/mwt2008/status/1998898338976911758/photo/1","id_str":"1998898331125198848","indices":[276,299],"media_key":"16_1998898331125198848","media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/G72DcQjWsAARcGC.jpg","type":"animated_gif","url":"https://t.co/SNsirf3oop","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"sizes":{"large":{"h":296,"w":500,"resize":"fit"},"medium":{"h":296,"w":500,"resize":"fit"},"small":{"h":296,"w":500,"resize":"fit"},"thumb":{"h":150,"w":150,"resize":"crop"}},"original_info":{"h